! Play the white keys only; each is one 13ed3 step (~146.3c) above the last, and a
! "piano octave" of 7 white keys = 1024.13c. Black keys are silent. Every white key
! sounds (regular, no gaps) because the scale repeats every 7 steps. Note 69 -> 440 Hz.
